---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy"
  description={`How ${site.name} handles your information: what we collect, what we never collect, and your choices.`}
  og="privacy"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy', path: '/privacy/' }]}
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="notice">
        <strong>Placeholder.</strong> The full privacy policy is being drafted and will be reviewed by an attorney before
        the app launches. This page describes what applies today, to the waitlist.
      </p>
      <h2>The waitlist</h2>
      <p>
        If you join the waitlist, we store your email address, the page you signed up from, and the time. We send one
        email asking you to confirm, and after that only news about the launch of {site.name}. We do not sell or share
        your email address. Every email has an unsubscribe link, and you can ask us to delete your address at any time.
      </p>
      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not use advertising or tracking cookies and does not load third-party analytics or ad scripts.
      </p>
      <h2>The app, in short</h2>
      <p>
        The app is designed so that your partner never sees which apps you pause, what you do in them, your messages or
        your location, and neither do we. The complete policy will be published here before launch.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy: <a href={`mailto:${site.privacyEmail}`}>{site.privacyEmail}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
